      "title": {
        "en": "Experienced and accommodating grooming team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently praise stylists such as Tatiana, Yelena, Rosy, and Anna for their attentiveness, warmth, and dedication. Clients appreciate that the team readily accommodates short-notice scheduling adjustments and treats returning pets with personal recognition and care."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 16,
      "title": {
        "en": "Skilled haircuts and breed styling"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers express great satisfaction with precise teddy-bear face cuts, deshedding treatments, and specialized feline grooming. While the overwhelming majority highlight clean, fluffy coats, an isolated review noted an instance where a dog's coat was returned damp."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 13,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle approach for nervous pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently observe that their dogs and cats feel comfortable and relaxed, with several noting that pets who usually fear groomers show no signs of trembling here. Pet parents emphasize the gentle touch used when brushing tangled coats or handling very young puppies."
      }
    }
  ],
